is renamed (engine_pin.py name --write: v0.9.2-omarchy.20261112.e9d6b719a549) and rebuilt
from the same authenticated engine.28 base: 17909447 bytes, sha256 cc5c25df...6d30, two
identical repacks. For the experimental J714s upstream image only.

